'''Navassa Central station''' ({{Lang-ca|Estació Central de Navassa}}) is the central station of [[Navassa]], [[Mesopotàmia]], in the north-west of [[Estuaria]]. It is located at the southern edge of Navassa's historic city ({{lang-ca|Ciutat Vella}}). The station is one of Navassa's two most important railway stations; the other one is [[Navassa Mestre railway station|Navassa Mestre]], a mainline [[W:Junction (rail)|junction station]] on Navassa's mainland district of [[Mestre]]. Both Central and Mestre station are managed by ''[[Compañía d'a Estación Confederales|Compañía d'Estación Confederales]].'' 

